{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20762","headline":"小妇吟 · 卢仝","name":"小妇吟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"小妇欲入门，隈门匀红妆。\n大妇出门迎，正顿罗衣裳。\n门边两相见，笑乐不可当。\n夫子於傍聊断肠，小妇哆㖷上高堂。\n开玉匣，取琴张。\n陈金罍，酌满觞。\n顾言两相乐，永与同心事我郎。\n夫子於傍剩欲狂，珠帘风度百花香。\n翠帐云屏白玉牀，啼鸟休啼花莫笑，女英新喜得娥皇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢仝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20762.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20762","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}